<QuestionLayout
  title="Can Traverse capabilities call native OS APIs?"
  description="Not directly — a capability can only reach outside its WASM sandbox through host calls the contract explicitly declares and the host explicitly implements. That constraint is exactly what keeps the capability portable across operating systems."
  canonical="https://traverse-framework.com/questions/can-traverse-capabilities-call-native-os-apis.html"
